/-!
# Source-generated sequential health cessation

One fixed actual-action program consumes the mandate-succession macro next
and recomputes the inventory whose sole service slot is health cessation.
Health power, `.t2` bearer, terminal responsibility, successor mandate, UBI
Payment, first target write and macro next are dependent readouts.  None is a
public producer argument.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14SourceGeneratedSequentialHealthCessation

